    "la": -14.483333,
    "ln": -146.316667,
    "sub": "France",
    "desc": "Ahe, Ahemaru or Omaru, is a coral atoll in the northern Tuamotu Archipelago, 14 km to the west of Manihi, in French Polynesia. Its ring shape is broken by only a single small passage into the lagoon. It has a land area of approximately 12 km² and a lagoon area of 138 km².",
